{"v":2,"catch":"巡邏。檢查。攔截。正義由你開始。","desc":"POLICE BORDER CONTRABAND PATROL SIMULATOR 是一款緊張刺激的邊境管制模擬遊戲，每一個決定都至關重要。從新手警員開始，檢查文件、揭露走私企圖，並在充滿腐敗與誘惑的世界中面對道德抉擇。 你會執行法律，還是為了私利而違背原則？晉升階級、承受壓力，並在多重結局中塑造屬於你的命運。\n\n主要特色：\n\t•\t進階的文件與身份驗證系統\n\t•\t搜查車輛隱藏區域中的違禁品\n\t•\t與駕駛者的直接互動：審問、逮捕、道德選擇\n\t•\t影響遊戲體驗的階級進展系統\n\t•\t黑市與走私任務機制\n\t•\t錯誤與道德決定將帶來真實後果\n\t•\t支援控制器與直覺化操作介面\n\n現已推出。是時候在邊境上展現你的立場——你會走多遠？","publisher":"Play Games","release":"2025-12-18","genres":["模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 2.5GB / Switch 2.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f76da4d927139fc5943125c42d702c0fd96e27cf2f1ca6f9e790213ee16653ae.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/50003975973b106231e66f09e6f1996a9de2af8dfc9d474d0f5f67fa07606b1b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f20f4ba26ec0e4a947a31487a9262c5aba777781af5244c94a6d15f353edb3c5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f5551a41b80aad9c76f4ae7cd68599220fd25561fbcc42ae1cbff5e05e842558.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c0347764fda0ebeedbf265d3d28c993026fe9b0e7b878a8a60cac66e0fa13dad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d9437887a4990c0dd123a04d752a9edee2df816a334f9591bed9b6e9d6591787.jpg"],"dlc":[{"id":"70050000074120","name":"POLICE BORDER CONTRABAND PATROL SIMULATOR: Border Horizon","img":"c3ebbda90d14c8d71d3f2fa9dedb3261d80ae45cf9c05913ead7eda37ed703c8","date":"2026-05-28","mem":false}],"dlcTotal":1,"titleId":"01004e902554c000"}